Okay, good afternoon, everyone. I want to remind council to be logged in on eScribe

04:03.720 --> 04:06.960
Thank you. Chair Redmond. Present. Councillor Craig.

04:07.460 --> 04:11.720
Present. Councillor Erb. Present. Councillor Foxton. Councillor Gowling. Councillor Harris. Councillor Hunnik.

04:12.220 --> 04:15.800
Chair James. Present. Councillor Liggett. Present. Councillor McCabe.

04:16.200 --> 04:20.440
Councillor Nowak. Councillor Gowling has

04:20.940 --> 04:24.280
just arrived. Councillor Rodriguez. Present. Councillor Salinon. Councillor Schantz. Present. Councillor Vrbanovic

04:26.140 --> 04:30.380
And Councillor Wolfe. Thank you, Chair. And Tim, we do

04:30.880 --> 04:33.340
have Quorom. That is correct.

04:34.220 --> 04:37.260
Okay, I want to move on to item two with the land acknowledgement. I'd like

04:37.760 --> 04:41.900
to acknowledge that the land in

04:42.400 --> 04:45.660
which we gather is the traditional territory of the Haudenosaunee, the Anishnaabe,

04:46.460 --> 04:49.660
and the Chonnonton. We continue to recognize the present, past,

04:49.740 --> 04:53.140
and future contributions and participation in our society and the stewarding of

04:53.640 --> 04:54.330
our land. Okay, next,

04:54.830 --> 04:59.650
I need

05:00.150 --> 05:03.450
a motion to reconvene in--

05:03.950 --> 05:07.370
hold on a second.

05:07.870 --> 05:11.050
Motion to reconvene. Okay,

05:11.550 --> 05:20.370
into open session. It's a typo on

05:20.870 --> 05:24.330
my script. Okay, Councillor Gowling, Councillor Liggett, and you'll be

05:24.830 --> 05:25.640
prompted in e-scribe.

