34:40.840 --> 34:42.276
civic and cultural landmark for the community. And the terminal was a public space and

34:42.776 --> 34:43.580
it should remain a public space.

35:13.440 --> 35:14.276
The former Charles Street Terminal has become a community hub where nonprofit organizations could become

35:15.180 --> 35:17.800
in Waterloo region. Imagine a place where organizations providing housing support, arts and culture programming,

35:18.300 --> 35:22.160
