35:32.900 --> 35:36.920
in 2021 and we are

35:37.420 --> 35:40.630
still here because we believe that

35:41.130 --> 35:45.240
this space should remain a civic space and to become something that

35:45.740 --> 35:49.720
the region of Waterloo truly deserves. We look forward to continuing working

35:50.220 --> 35:53.080
with you on this project. Thank you,

35:53.580 --> 35:56.760
Bengishimo. I see no questions.

