01:20:11.620 --> 01:20:15.220
And then we're also looking forward

01:20:15.700 --> 01:20:21.140
to some innovative financing strategies whereby we can work with external partners

01:20:21.640 --> 01:20:25.410
to find ways to support decarbonization and fuel switching, because we

01:20:25.910 --> 01:20:26.380
