01:31:32.460 --> 01:31:35.940
from the 2025 calendar year as well as introduce some existing initiatives for

01:31:36.440 --> 01:31:40.640
2026. The program includes the responsible forest management of the region's 17 regional forests

01:31:41.360 --> 01:31:45.440
as well as the implementation and

01:31:45.940 --> 01:31:49.090
enforcement of the Woodland Conservation Bylaw which regulates the destruction and cutting of trees on

01:31:49.590 --> 01:31:53.930
private lands in woodlands greater than one hectare in

01:31:54.430 --> 01:31:58.370
size or larger through the permitting process and the strong encouragement

01:31:58.870 --> 01:32:02.330
