01:47:15.760 --> 01:47:19.460
And our recovery was get back our cost recovery

01:47:19.960 --> 01:47:22.500
ratio to 30%. A reminder, our target is 40%. We're not there yet. Put simply,

01:47:22.740 --> 01:47:26.900
you give GRT $1 and today we returned 30 cents. That's in line

01:47:27.060 --> 01:47:30.540
